        "node_type": "paragraph",
        "level": 0,
        "text": "CAPTAIN LYSANDRA IRONVEIL IS A FORMIDABLE AND IMPOSING FIGURE, STANDING AT SIX FEET TALL WITH A MUSCULAR BUILD HONED FROM YEARS OF RIGOROUS TRAINING AND COMBAT. HER SKIN IS A RICH TAN, MARKED BY A FEW BATTLE SCARS THAT SPEAK TO HER EXPERIENCE AND RESILIENCE. LYSANDRA'S PIERCING BLUE EYES ARE SHARP AND OBSERVANT, CONSTANTLY SCANNING HER SURROUNDINGS FOR ANY SIGN OF TROUBLE. HER HAIR IS A CASCADE OF DARK, WAVY LOCKS THAT SHE OFTEN TIES BACK IN A PRACTICAL BRAID DURING DUTY HOURS. SHE WEARS THE TRADITIONAL ARMOR OF THE MIRATHORN GUARD, BUT WITH ADDITIONAL ORNATE ENGRAVINGS AND A CLOAK THAT SIGNIFIES HER RANK AS CAPTAIN. THE ARMOR, POLISHED TO A GLEAMING FINISH, BEARS THE EMBLEM OF THE CITY—A MOUNTAIN PEAK ABOVE A TRANQUIL LAKE.",
